liblouis
--------
The SDK builds liblouis (https://liblouis.io), downloaded from its release tarball by
build-louis.sh, into a separate shared library, libbraillesense-louis.so, which the SDK loads at run
time. liblouis is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later; it is
not covered by the Apache License. Its braille tables, copied into the APK's assets, are under their
own licences as stated in each table file (most under the LGPL 2.1 or later). An app that ships the
SDK ships liblouis as that separate library and must meet the LGPL's terms for it, such as
offering its source and allowing it to be replaced.
